WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:05.365
Today’s task: a design worth exactly 2 hexagons.

2
00:00:05.365 --> 00:00:07.974
Tap a block in the palette to put it on the board.

3
00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:11.535
The total counts in hexagons. Add 3 parallelograms.

4
00:00:11.535 --> 00:00:14.554
Hold a block, or right-click it, for its wheel.

5
00:00:14.554 --> 00:00:18.287
Rotate turns it 30 degrees. Flip turns it over.

6
00:00:18.287 --> 00:00:20.684
Drag a block to move it.

7
00:00:20.684 --> 00:00:23.510
Drag a work mat from the palette onto the board.

8
00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:26.038
Drag on empty space to select several blocks.

9
00:00:26.038 --> 00:00:29.096
Drag one, and they all move. The mat counts them.

10
00:00:29.096 --> 00:00:31.550
The design is worth 2 hexagons.

11
00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:35.157
Totals off hides the count, so students work it out.

12
00:00:35.157 --> 00:00:43.346
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
